# The Finančná správa SR document this module's Slovak rules were read against.
#
# "Transpozície štandardu Peppol BIS v podmienkach Slovenskej legislatívy" is
# a workbook, not a schema: it lists every EN 16931 business term with the
# column "Povinná náležitosť faktúry podľa SK legislatívy" (vyžaduje sa /
# podmienene vyžadované / nevyžaduje sa) and comments. It adds no validation
# rule of its own; the rule sheets repeat EN 16931 and Peppol BIS Billing 3.0.
#
# The file is replaced in place under a new name with every revision, and the
# workbook's first sheet ("Úvod") lists what each revision changed.
#
# Refresh procedure:
#   1. open https://www.financnasprava.sk/sk/podnikatelia/dane/dan-z-pridanej-hodnoty/e-faktura
#      (section "Validačné pravidlá") and compare the version with the one below;
#   2. read the change list on the sheet "Úvod" from the pinned version on;
#   3. re-check the terms listed in doc/en.md ("What the transposition asks
#      for") against the sheet "Obchod. term.(legis.) validácia";
#   4. update this file, the version named in doc/*.md and the test.
